pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "#FFFFFF"
elements:
- elementId: top-bar
  elementType: shape
  bounds: [0, 0, 1280, 6]
  shapeName: rect
  fill:
    type: solid
    color: $primary
- elementId: badge-bg
  elementType: shape
  bounds: [60, 10, 120, 18]
  shapeName: rect
  fill:
    type: solid
    color: $primary
- elementId: badge-text
  elementType: text
  bounds: [60, 10, 120, 18]
  content:
    fontSize: 12
    color: #FFFFFF
    fontFamily: Inter, MiSans
    lineHeight: 1.0
    align: [center, middle]
    wrap: False
    text: |
      CH10
- elementId: title
  elementType: text
  bounds: [60, 30, 1000, 45]
  content:
    fontSize: 32
    color: $primary
    fontFamily: Inter, MiSans
    lineHeight: 1.5
    wrap: True
    text: |
      <p><strong>RISC-V CoVE-IO 规范草案 — 内容摘要</strong></p>
- elementId: title-line
  elementType: shape
  bounds: [60, 78, 120, 3]
  shapeName: rect
  fill:
    type: solid
    color: $primary
- elementId: ev-badge-bg
  elementType: shape
  bounds: [1080, 30, 140, 22]
  shapeName: rect
  fill:
    type: solid
    color: $accent
- elementId: ev-badge-text
  elementType: text
  bounds: [1080, 30, 140, 22]
  content:
    fontSize: 12
    color: #FFFFFF
    fontFamily: Inter, MiSans
    lineHeight: 1.0
    align: [center, middle]
    wrap: False
    text: |
      E3 / Draft
- elementId: body
  elementType: text
  bounds: [60, 90, 1160, 560]
  content:
    fontSize: 18
    color: $text
    fontFamily: Inter, MiSans
    lineHeight: 1.5
    wrap: True
    text: |
      <p><strong>核心论点：</strong>定义 RISC-V CoVE-IO confidential I/O 架构，把 TVM 设备使用扩展到 device identity、DMA/MMIO、interrupt 和 link security。</p>
      <p>CoVE-IO and TEE-I/O draft 是当前 RISC-V confidential I/O 的标准轨道 SOTA。</p>
      <p>用 TDI/TDM/DSM、SPDM、TDISP、PCIe IDE、trusted MSI 等机制组合描述 draft confidential I/O lifecycle。</p>
- elementId: source
  elementType: text
  bounds: [60, 690, 1160, 20]
  content:
    fontSize: 14
    color: $secondary
    fontFamily: Inter, MiSans
    lineHeight: 1.2
    wrap: True
    text: |
      来源：RISC-V CoVE-IO 规范草案｜证据等级：E3 / Draft-not-ratified
- elementId: bottom-bar
  elementType: shape
  bounds: [0, 714, 1280, 6]
  shapeName: rect
  fill:
    type: solid
    color: $primary
